# THE LEVIATHAN -- the big kraken that `kraken_ascendancy` has been feeding, and
# the thing that lives at depth 8 of THE DIVE. Design jam #3, designer D.
# Preview:  godot --headless --path . --script tools/ship_preview.gd -- <this> out.svg
#
# ANATOMY (jam #2's standing ruling, owner from the source): the SHELL (K) is an
# outer CASING -- two cells thick everywhere, so at 8x it is a 16-block plate --
# wrapping a MEAT (M) interior. Only a LITTLE meat is exposed, and every exposed
# cell is deliberate: the THROAT behind the shell fangs, and the six tentacle
# ARMS of the crown. Krakens carry no blubber (no W); the brain holds them aloft
# (WhaleAI._altitude_hold_accel) and a carcass falls.
#
# READS LEFT-TO-RIGHT WITH +x LEADING (the 2026-08-24 mirroring scar -- a
# creature's drawn facing follows its motion, +x in front):
#
#   RIGHT (+x, leading)   the RAM SPIRE: the last 17 columns taper from nine
#                         rows to a single cell, solid shell all the way. The
#                         struck cell's collision_resist 20 divides the bruise
#                         (Ship._apply_impacts), so it rams and mines and pays a
#                         twentieth of the bill a meat nose would.
#   MIDDLE                the MANTLE: 2-thick casing over a meat bulk, with THE
#                         HOARD -- a sealed 12-cell loot cavity walled in meat,
#                         cracked off the carcass exactly as kraken_c's is
#                         (Ship.cavity_cells / harvest_cell).
#   LEFT (-x, trailing)   the HEAD: a pinched neck, then shell JAW PLATES above
#                         and below a NINE-ROW MAW. The gullet narrows to a
#                         bare-MEAT THROAT and a meat back wall -- ELEVEN cells,
#                         the only soft skin on the body proper (11% of its
#                         100-cell hide; the other 89 are shell).
#   FURTHER LEFT          THE CROWN: six exposed-MEAT tentacle ARMS, one cell
#                         thick (eight blocks at 8x), trailing 12 columns and
#                         fanning -- two sweeping out, two straight, two curling
#                         in across the mouth's plane.
#
# WHERE THE MOUTH LANDS IS DERIVED, NOT AUTHORED: KrakenAI._compute_mouth_local
# takes the centroid of exterior-exposed MEAT. Throat plus crown put it OUTSIDE
# the jaw lip, in the middle of the arms -- so the shipped grab (kraken_grab_dps
# 120 hp/s within kraken_grab_reach 70 px x scale_unit) fires FROM THE
# TENTACLES. That is the whole trick: the arms are the bite, with no new code.
#
#   K shell (hp 250, mass 2, collision_resist 20 -- light, very hard)
#   M meat  (hp 50, mass 8 -- the interior bulk, the throat, the arms)
#   . air   (the open maw, and the sealed hoard)

name The Leviathan
kind kraken_leviathan
group bosses
health 3600
tame 9
bounty 900
notes jam 3 designer D. tame 9 is ABOVE the perk ceiling (StatDB Master Trader grants taming 3) -- that is how a body is made untameable; tame 0 would make it tameable by ANYONE (world.try_tame compares taming_level() < tame_level).

origin 25 12

